 to talk about actions which are happening at the present moment, but will soon finish.</br> Contractions or short forms of the verb are usually used in speaking.</br> Here are some examples in the affirmative and negative forms.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":8,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Affirmative \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Negative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I am\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I'm playing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I am not\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm not playing<span class=\\\"italic\\\">\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You are\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You're playing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You are not\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You're not playing/You aren't playing<span class=\\\"italic\\\">\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"He is\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"He's playing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"He is not\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">He's not playing/He isn't playing<span class=\\\"italic\\\">\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"She is\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"She's playing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"She is not\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">She's not playing/She isn't playing<span class=\\\"italic\\\">\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"We are\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"We're playing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"We are not\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">We're not playing/We aren't playing<span class=\\\"italic\\\">\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"They are\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"They're playing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"They are not\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">They're not playing<span class=\\\"italic\\\">\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "weather ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the temperature and other outside conditions ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The weather is so nice today. There's not a cloud in the sky.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le12ob04aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you hear in a conversation about a day tour.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "whitecap ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "waves that break into small white bubbles", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There are whitecaps on the bay.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le12ob04aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "sharp", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to an exact time; precise", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Be at my house at 4 p.m. sharp!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le12ob04aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "windsurfing", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an activity where you ride along the surface of the water while standing on a long, narrow board ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I love to go windsurfing in Baja.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le12ob04aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "wild", "type": "name"}, {"content": "uncontrolled and dangerous", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The wild weather made everyone nervous.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le12ob04aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "wind ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " the natural movement of air outside", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The wind was very strong.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le12ob04aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "wife", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a married woman", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My wife and I are going on a cruise ship.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le12ob04aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Write 8-10 lines.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask two questions like <span class=\"italic\">Where do you want to go?</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Decide where you want to go.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Decide if you need to bring special equipment.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read the dialogue aloud.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I write a dialogue about planning a day trip.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I practice the dialogue.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I proofread my work.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "", "images": [{"image": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "text": "Baja California is a beautiful peninsula. It lies between the Pacific Ocean and the Sea of Cortez and is one thousand miles long."}, {"image": "", "id": 1, "time": "9301", "text": "People can get there by land, sea or air. In Baja they find deserts, mountains and islands. They also find whales, all kinds of tropical fish and other sea life."}, {"image": "", "id": 2, "time": "22101", "text": "Diving is very popular in Baja. Both new and experienced divers enjoy diving there."}], "coverimg": ""}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "id": 1}, {"title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn4le12ob04re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn4le12ob04re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "time": "0", "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn4le12ob04re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "time": "0090", "text": "<span class  = \"strong\">John</span>: Excuse me, are you taking the windsurfing day tour today?</br>\n<span class  = \"strong\">Tourist</span>: Yes, actually. How did you know?</br>"}, {"image": "engenn4le12ob04re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "time": "5500", "text": "<span class  = \"strong\">John</span>: I heard you and your wife talking at breakfast this morning.</br>\n<span class  = \"strong\">Tourist</span>: Yes, we are looking forward to windsurfing in Baja.</br>"}, {"image": "engenn4le12ob04re2img03.jpg", "id": 3, "time": "12000", "text": "<span class  = \"strong\">John</span>: The weather looks miserable. There are whitecaps on the water.  It's so windy today!</br>\n<span class  = \"strong\">Tourist</span>: I agree. The weather is pretty wild. We are feeling a little nervous!</br>"}, {"image": "engenn4le12ob04re2img02.jpg", "id": 4, "time": "22200", "text": "<span class  = \"strong\">John</span>: Don't worry. Windsurfing in Baja is a wonderful experience.</br>\n<span class  = \"strong\">Tourist</span>: Hmm. We shall see.</br>"}, {"image": "engenn4le12ob04re2img01.jpg", "id": 5, "time": "28500", "text": "<span class  = \"strong\">John</span>: Are you renting the equipment on the cruise ship or on the beach?</br>\n<span class  = \"strong\">Tourist</span>: On the beach. What time is the bus picking up the passengers?</br>\n<span class  = \"strong\">John</span>: 8 a.m. sharp, I am planning to join the group today.</br>\n<span class  = \"strong\">Tourist</span>: That's great!</br>"}], "coverimg": "engenn4le12ob04re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "id": 2}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Vocabulary and Grammar", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "I can say and use words that start with W. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can talk about what people are doing and not doing.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can identify key information in a short audio.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "How often do you go to the beach?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Do you prefer swimming in a pool or in the ocean? Why?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct"}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Pronunciation Spot: It's a great day for windsurfing! ", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "questions": []},